<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
LinkForge (Blender) exports inmoov_i2.urdf.xacro in raw CAD/Blender scene
units, not meters — every <origin xyz> and <mesh scale> in that file is
written as ${model_scale*...} against this property.

0.10604 (2026-10-05) is recalibrated against the physical robot: in the zero
pose the crown is 1.81 m above the floor, stand included. It replaced 0.1196,
carried over from the old Sentience-Robotics inmoov_urdf properties.xacro.

The mass/inertia estimate (scripts/inertia_estimate.json) is stored in SI
units for this scale: after changing model_scale, recompute it with
scripts/claude_compute_inertia.py and re-apply it.
-->
<robot xmlns:xacro="http://www.ros.org/wiki/xacro">

  <xacro:property name="model_scale" value="0.10604"/>

</robot>
